{
  "_doc": [
    "SHARED VECTORS for searchRank — the one tiered rule every phone-side search",
    "uses (docs/design-docs/search-and-matching.md).",
    "",
    "The corpus rows and titles below are REAL rows of supabase/seed/snapshot.jsonl",
    "and of the extraction gold set, so every expectation here was measured",
    "against the shipped 308-row vocabulary before it was written down. Three",
    "test groups read this file: searchRank alone (search_rank_test.dart), the",
    "same queries through real SQLite (ingredient_repository_test.dart), and the",
    "cross-picker equality test that asserts the planning picker and the editor's",
    "'Your recipes' section return identical sets (line_target_picker_test.dart).",
    "",
    "`refusals` is the guard's spine: every entry MUST return nothing. Three",
    "characters is where the phone stops guessing. `tier1_answers` is its mirror:",
    "these are exact word prefixes, so tier 2 must never run for them at all."
  ],

